[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

The beaver  is a large, primarily nocturnal, semiaquatic rodent. They'll occasionally spawn in some shallow water but can rarely be seen hanging out in the middle of forests too.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Like Swans they might attack you on very rare occasion if you get all up in their grill but generally they won't take to your presence. 

